    "descriptor_aggregation": "For equal-length candidate and support peptides: delta = candidate-AA-vector minus support-AA-vector at each position. Concatenate mean(delta) [5], mean(abs(delta)) [5], maximum per-position Euclidean norm [1], mismatch fraction [1]. Unequal lengths unsupported.",
